1
00:00:01,060 --> 00:00:10,640
Van Mieu - Quoc Tu Giam

2
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:23,130
Van Mieu - Quoc Tu Giam (in Hanoi capital) is Vietnam's first university.

3
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:33,130
From 1075, our country opened doctoral examination.

4
00:00:33,130 --> 00:00:47,440
For 10 centuries, from doctoral exam year 1075 to last doctoral exam year 1919,

5
00:00:48,130 --> 00:00:56,820
Vietnamese kings organized 185 exams,

6
00:00:56,820 --> 00:01:01,930
took nearly 3000 doctors,

7
00:01:01,930 --> 00:01:11,260
specifically as follows:

8
00:01:11,950 --> 00:01:31,200
Today, visitors to Van Mieu - Quoc Tu Giam can still see by Thien Quang well, under rows of old stone steles,

9
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:57,040
82 steles inscribed with names of 1306 doctors from exam year 1442 to exam year 1779

10
00:01:58,860 --> 00:02:05,400
as evidence of a long-standing educational tradition.

